# Implementation Plan: Seller and Buyer Modules for Snack Bazaar

This plan outlines the architecture, layout, navigation, and mock data for adding the **Seller Portal** and **Buyer/User Portal** to the Snack Bazaar Flutter application, matching the provided Figma designs.

The existing **Admin Portal** remains completely unmodified.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Role Selection Entry Point**: We will modify `lib/app.dart` to launch a beautiful **Role Selector Screen** at startup. This screen allows navigating into either the **Admin Portal**, **Seller Portal**, or **Buyer Portal**. This enables testing all three modules within the same application runner.

---

